@startuml CampusClassDiagram

title 校园二手交易系统 - UML类图

top to bottom direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFE
  BorderColor #60768F
  ArrowColor #60768F
}
hide circle

class User {
  - userId : int
  - username : String
  - passwordHash : String
  - roles : Set<UserRole>
  + login() : boolean
}

enum UserRole {
  BUYER
  SELLER
  ADMIN
}

class Product {
  - productId : int
  - title : String
  - description : String
  - price : Decimal
  - condition : String
  - status : ProductStatus
  + submitForReview() : boolean
  + updateInfo() : boolean
  + takeDown() : boolean
}

enum ProductStatus {
  DRAFT
  PENDING_REVIEW
  REJECTED
  ON_SALE
  RESERVED
  TAKEN_DOWN
  SOLD
}

class Reservation {
  - reservationId : int
  - requestId : String
  - status : ReservationStatus
  - createdAt : DateTime
  - confirmedAt : DateTime
  + cancel() : boolean
  + confirm() : boolean
  + complete() : boolean
}

enum ReservationStatus {
  PENDING
  CONFIRMED
  CANCELLED
  REJECTED
  EXPIRED
  COMPLETED
}

class Category {
  - categoryId : int
  - name : String
}

class AuditRecord {
  - auditId : int
  - auditorId : int
  - result : String
  - reason : String
  - auditedAt : DateTime
}

class OperationLog {
  - logId : int
  - operatorId : int
  - action : String
  - targetId : int
  - result : String
  - operatedAt : DateTime
}

User "1" -down- "0..*" Product : 发布商品
User "1" -down- "0..*" Reservation : 发起预约
Product "1" -right- "0..*" Reservation : 历史预约
Category "1" -right- "0..*" Product : 归属分类
Product "1" -down- "0..*" AuditRecord : 审核历史
User "1" -right- "0..*" OperationLog : 操作日志

UserRole -[hidden]left- User
ProductStatus -[hidden]left- Product
Reservation -[hidden]right- ReservationStatus

note bottom of Reservation
  一个商品可以有多条历史预约，
  但任一时刻最多只有一条有效预约；
  商品和预约状态须同步更新。
end note

@enduml
